    holon:hasContextGraph <https://example.org/openevidence/questions/q_addison_disease_efficacy-con> ;
    holon:evidenceQualityThreshold "0.38"^^xsd:decimal .

<https://example.org/openevidence/drugs/prednisone> oe:treats <https://example.org/openevidence/diseases/addison_disease> .
